  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The conversion of the property from six bed-sits to a single-family house, would be acceptable due to the cramped size of the existing accommodation. The conversion would not harm neighbours living conditions, would preserve the character of St Stephen's Conservation Area and would not result in conditions prejudicial to highway safety. The proposal therefore accords with adopted Unitary Development Plan policies ENV-B.1.1 (New development), ENV-B.2.2 (Conservation areas), H.3.4A (Houses in multiple occupation) and T.1.4 (Car and cycle parking and servicing facilities for developments).",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission."
